1
00:00:00,558 --> 00:00:01,348
大家好！
Hey everyone!

2
00:00:01,838 --> 00:00:07,460
今天我想聊聊光子逻辑门，重点讨论它们工作背后的原理。
Today I want to talk about photonic logic gates and focus on the principles behind how they work.

3
00:00:08,013 --> 00:00:14,980
正如大家所知，光子计算目前是个挺火的话题，尤其是随着各种光子计算硬件纷纷上市。
As you may know, photonic computing is currently a pretty hot topic,
especially with all the photonic computing hardware coming to the market.

4
00:00:15,342 --> 00:00:22,180
但这项技术的基础是可以用光学原理实现的简单逻辑运算。
But at the basis of this technology are simple logic operations that can be created using optical principles.

5
00:00:22,542 --> 00:00:28,356
所以，我想在视频中解释这些逻辑运算在最基础层面上是如何工作的。
So, what I want to do in this video is explain how these logic operations work on a very fundamental level.

6
00:00:29,358 --> 00:00:38,500
但在深入讨论之前，我想先说明一下，你们可以用我制作这个视频时用的软件，
自己完成视频中展示的所有模拟。
But before we go into that, I first want to mention that you can do every simulation
shown in this video yourself using the software that I used to make this video.

7
